rule AvailabilityDefinition
	lineageTag: e8b78d4e-db69-554c-ab00-dc304b400085
	statement: Availability is measured as running samples divided by all machine-status samples, so Idle time (Starved or Blocked) lowers a machine's measured availability. The plant policy document defines Availability excluding Idle; reports, dashboards, and agents use the measured definition.

	ruleReferencedEntity equipment#Machine
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty is_running
		ruleReferencedProperty machine_status
